  "ruleText": "Ban 1104.10 Additional Coverage. A bank, nondepository trust company or credit union may maintain additional fidelity bond coverage through the use of endorsements, riders or other forms of supplemental coverage.\n\nSource. #6536, eff 7-2-97, EXPIRED: 7-2-05\n\nNew. #9767, eff 8-21-10, EXPIRED: 8-21-18",
